### Cadastrando Funcionario

POST http://localhost:3000/funcionario
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "a",
    "email": "email1",
    "senha": "senha1"
}

### Login
# @name valToken

POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "email1",
    "senha": "senha1"
}

###Cadastrar Motorista

POST http://localhost:3000/motorista
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "a",
    "cnh": "cnh1",
    "cpf": "cpf1",
    "telefone": "telefone1"
}
### listar motorista
GET http://localhost:3000/motoristas
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
### buscar id motorista
GET http://localhost:3000/motorista/id/1
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
### buscar nome motorista
GET http://localhost:3000/motorista/nome/a
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
###Atualizar
PATCH http://localhost:3000/motoristas/1
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "nome": "jose",
    "cnh": "cnh1",
    "cpf": "cpf1",
    "telefone": "telefone1"
}
###Apagar
DELETE  http://localhost:3000/motoristas/1
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "nome": "jose",
    "cnh": "cnh1",
    "cpf": "cpf1",
    "telefone": "telefone1"
}
###CADASTRA CARGA
POST http://localhost:3000/carga
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "descricao": "aracaju",
    "peso": 10,
    "volume": 12,
    "codRastreio": "1",
    "idMotorista": 2
}
###CADASTRA ENTREGA
POST http://localhost:3000/entrega
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "cidadeDestino": "aracaju",
    "statusAtual": "ENTREGUE",
    "dataHora": "2026-10-27T09:00:00",
    "idCarga": 1
}
###Listar ENTREGAs
GET http://localhost:3000/entregas
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json